- Protecting Yourself from Recruitment Scams
- Anduril is committed to maintaining the integrity of our Talent acquisition process and the security of our candidates. We've observed a rise in sophisticated phishing and fraudulent schemes where individuals impersonate Anduril representatives, luring job seekers with false interviews or job offers. These scammers often attempt to extract payment or sensitive personal information. To ensure your safety and help you navigate your job search with confidence, please keep the following critical points in mind: No Financial Requests: Anduril will never solicit payment or demand personal financial details (such as banking information, credit card numbers, or social security numbers) at any stage of our hiring process. Our legitimate recruitment is entirely free for candidates. Please always verify communications: Direct from Anduril: If you receive an email from one of our recruiters, it will only come from an @anduril.com address. Via Agency Partner: If contacted by a recruiting agency for an Anduril role, their email will clearly identify their agency. If you suspect any suspicious activity, please verify the agency's authenticity by reaching out to contact@anduril.com. Exercise Caution with Unsolicited Outreach: If you receive any communication that appears suspicious, contains grammatical errors, or makes unusual requests, do not engage. Always confirm the sender's email domain is @anduril.com before providing any personal information or clicking on links. What to Do If You Suspect Fraud: Should you encounter any questionable or fraudulent outreach claiming to be from Anduril, please report it immediately to contact@anduril.com. Your proactive caution is invaluable in protecting your personal information and upholding the security and trustworthiness of our recruitment efforts.


## Command & Control
- Command & Control
- LATTICE
- COMMAND AND CONTROL
- Lattice for Command & Control (C2) is an AI-powered battle management platform built to accelerate complex kill chains. Lattice for C2 integrates thousands of sensors and effectors to turn data into decisions at scales and speeds beyond human capacity.
- Kill Chain
  - 01, Understand: Lattice creates a shared real-time understanding of the battlespace. It autonomously parses data from thousands of sensors & data sources into an intelligent common operating picture, all in a single pane of glass.
  - 02, Decide: Lattice streamlines the complexity of the decision-making process by presenting decision points -- not noise. Lattice leverages AI and deep learning models to present recommended decision support to operators in high-stakes and dynamic environments, where decisions must be made quickly.
  - 03, Act: Lattice turns decisions into action in seconds, not minutes or hours by tasking manned, unmanned, and autonomous assets across multiple domains, distributed geographies, and contested communications environments.
- Accelerate complex kill chains
- Features
  - Built for Scale: Lattice can integrate, manage, and C2 thousands of sensors, effectors, networks, and mission systems globally across domains.
  - All-Domain: Lattice integrates and operates across land, sea, air, and space to provide a comprehensive all-domain mission engine.
  - Open & Extensible : Integrate third-party, legacy, and autonomous systems to work together in a single command and control mission engine.
  - Intelligent & Secure Networking: Intelligent mesh networking ensures resilient, intelligent, and secure transport of mission critical data to and from the tactical edge.
- Battle Management Platform
  - Built for Autonomy at Scale: Lattice for C2 is the human machine interface built to meet the complexity and scale of operating manned, unmanned and autonomous systems. Lattice for C2 simplifies the fleet management of hundreds of systems, fuses thousands of data signals into operator insights, and turns a click of a button into action with machine-to-machine tasking.
  - Disperse to Win: Lattice for C2 leverages a distributed mesh network, Lattice Mesh, to bring the realities of warfighters at the tactical edge back to the sensors and weapon systems operations centers. Lattice for C2 can be deployed across multiple modalities to meet the environment, ranging from laptops to tablets to operator-worn headsets.
  - The Best of Today and Tomorrow: Lattice for C2 integrates legacy and next-generations sensors, effectors, networks, and mission systems in a bidirectional manner with the Lattice SDK to provide an an intelligent, comprehensive, and capable common operating picture in a single pane of glass.
  - AI Applied to the Fight: Lattice for C2 leverages frontier AI technologies that enable natural operator interactions and decision aides to make rapid, confident, and effective decisions at machine speed.
