- Intro
Rebooting the Arsenal of Democracy
  - It is time to recapture the spirit of innovation
- ![Image](https://cdn.sanity.io/images/61nocsj5/production/be7e1af9b9aa95a949829e3ba36aca5a7f450197-4096x2858.jpg?w=1000&fit=min&auto=format)
